      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "A recommendation system is an artificial intelligence or AI algorithm, usually associated with machine learning, \nthat uses Big Data to suggest or recommend additional products to consumers. These can be based on various criteria, \nincluding past purchases, search history, demographic information, and other factors. ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A recommendation system is an artificial intelligence or AI algorithm, usually associated with machine learning, \nthat uses Big Data to suggest or recommend additional products to consumers. These can be based on various criteria, \nincluding past purchases, search history, demographic information, and other factors. ",
