      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "For a certain user U (User), in a specific scenario C (Context), \n\nbuild a function for massive “item” information, \npredict the user’s preference for a specific candidate item I (Item), \n\nand then sort all candidate items according to the preference \nto generate a recommendation list.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ZgB1s-weKgn33OHoJXriT",
